      {
        "id": 228558,
        "name": "ErekLich",
        "username": "ErekLich",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/f6c823/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-09-01T19:35:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Misdirection doesn't actually redirect the damage to the user at any point, so his DR doesn't affect the damage at all.&nbsp; That said, you're quite right that you kinda want to roll low here.&nbsp; Ideally, you actually want to assign a d6 power to Misdirection!</p>",
